WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.779
Begin with the actual path of the work.

00:00:02.779 --> 00:00:09.378
A request arrives, its inputs are checked, missing details are requested, and an estimate is prepared for human review.

00:00:09.378 --> 00:00:15.283
This is a workflow because we can trace the people, decisions and handoffs—not merely list the tasks.

00:00:15.283 --> 00:00:18.756
We must label any invented step as a fictional example.
